### ============================================
### BANKING API TESTING
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080/api
### ============================================

### 1. GET - Get all accounts
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts

### 2. POST - Create a new account
POST http://localhost:8080/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "initialDeposit": 1000
}

### 3. GET - Get a specific account
GET http://localhost:8080/api/account?accountNumber=ACC-0000000001

### 4. POST - Deposit money
POST http://localhost:8080/api/deposit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountNumber": "ACC-0000000001",
  "amount": 500
}

### 5. POST - Withdraw money
POST http://localhost:8080/api/withdraw
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountNumber": "ACC-0000000001",
  "amount": 200
}

### 6. POST - Transfer money
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-0000000001",
  "toAccount": "ACC-0000000002",
  "amount": 100,
  "remark": "Test transfer"
}

### 7. GET - Get transaction history
GET http://localhost:8080/api/transactions?accountNumber=ACC-0000000001

### 8. GET - Get mini statement
GET http://localhost:8080/api/mini-statement?accountNumber=ACC-0000000001

### 9. POST - Create another account
POST http://localhost:8080/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Smith",
  "initialDeposit": 500
}

### 10. GET - Check balance after transfer
GET http://localhost:8080/api/account?accountNumber=ACC-0000000002